水及商皆属弘农，今言顺阳，是魏、晋始分置顺阳郡，商及丹水皆属之也。水经注：丹水迳南鄕、丹水二县之间，历于中之北，所谓商于者也。杜佑曰：今邓州内鄕县东七里有于村，盖秦所谓商州。商洛县，古商邑，卨所封也；汉为商县。于，如字。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c3297db-db0e-11ef-9550-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"封爵","official_name":"商君","official_note":"商君是封号，源自商於十五邑的封地，表示卫鞅受封为君，在秦国具有贵族地位，常用于指代封君或封爵，此处用于尊称卫鞅。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"號曰商君","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b385ad09-a1fa-4471-863a-c2c5ac5f4646"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"衞鞅","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞鞅","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c329802-db0e-11ef-b86d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-390,"link_death_year":-338,"link_td_description":"商鞅（前390年—前338年），又称卫鞅或公孙鞅，是战国中期卫国人，公元前4世纪的重要政治家和军事家，也是法家代表人物之一，师从李悝。","link_td_id":"Q10000225","link_td_number_id":5851,"people_name":"商君","people_name_jianti_auto":"商君","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c329805-db0e-11ef-b750-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c329803-db0e-11ef-9951-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"商於","place_name_jianti_auto":"商于","resolved_place_entity_id":3109,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c329804-db0e-11ef-8077-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"河西之战（后期）","tongjian_id":"war_N0507"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。始皇并天下，属内史。汉属弘农郡。后汉属京兆尹。晋初为...","context_before":"...魏。《国策》：楚、魏战于陉山，魏许秦以上雒]。战国属秦[","source_end_index":80,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"5419e65e-1fa8-5262-b91d-a16b17bc6c7d","source_start_index":71,"source_text":"卫鞅封于此，为商君"},{"context_after":"，张仪以绐楚怀王也。汉置商县，属弘农郡。后汉属京兆尹。晋...","context_before":"...九十里。古商邑，契所封也。战国时为商于地。盖近南阳之界，","source_end_index":40,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8eeef47e-e247-5108-a54e-816d9dd1bfc6","source_start_index":35,"source_text":"秦商君封此"}],"path"